# PSR-4b-exports-2 — host-private ≤30

## Scope

| Work | Done |
| --- | --- |
| Retarget `./host/draft` consumers → unification surface | Yes |
| Peel `./host/draft` | Yes |
| Fold `http.module` → `./http`; peel `./host/http/routes` | Yes |
| Move ghost paths → composite registry surface; peel `./host/composites` | Yes |
| Collapse message locale keys → `./host/messages/*/wizard.json` | Yes |
| Reach ≤30 host-visible | **Yes (۳۰)** |

Land commit: `e99ad595`

Machine inventory:
[`psr-4b-exports-2-inventory.yaml`](./psr-4b-exports-2-inventory.yaml)

## Method notes

### Draft (not root barrel)

Encapsulation prefers `/host/<module>` over widening package root. Tests now import
`@app-tour/workspace-denali/host/draft/wizard-draft-unification-surface`, which re-exports
merge/hydrate/schema-gate helpers. Latent typo fixed:
`createOperatorDraftSchemaGate` → `createDenaliDraftSchemaGate`.

### http/routes

`http/index.ts` already re-exports `./routes`. Denali
`workspace.manifest.json` `http.module` retargeted to `./http`.

### composites

Only consumer was generated canonical binding. Manifest
`formProfileGhostPathsModule` now points at
`./composites/wizard-composite-registry-surface` (named export
`DENALI_FORM_PROFILE_GHOST_PATHS`).

### messages wildcard

Two host-private keys collapsed to one pattern export. Codegen import paths
(`…/host/messages/{fa,en}/wizard.json`) unchanged — served by the wildcard.

